        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c8df1aab-1309-50fb-9212-5c9512dc0b97",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Seibold, Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, Alex Lambert, Cheryl, Tempah, Wayne Wilkins, Heidi Rojas, Kevin Anyaeji, Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Matthew Wilder, Toby Gad\n- Works: Frames, Crazy Stupid Love, Big Time Rush, No Ordinary Family, The Secret Life of the American Teenager\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon, ABC, ABC Family\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, producer, co-writer\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Seibold has worked with artists including Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, and Alex Lambert.\n- Katelyn Tarver is known for recurring roles as Jo Taylor on Nickelodeon's Big Time Rush, Natalie on ABC's No Ordinary Family, and Mercedes on ABC Family's The Secret Life of the American Teenager.\n- On the album Frames, Lee DeWyze had six solo writing credits and co-wrote all other songs with Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Rick Seibold, Matthew Wilder, and Toby Gad.\n- The song Crazy Stupid Love was co-written by Cheryl, Tempah, Wayne Wilkins, Heidi Rojas, Katelyn Tarver, and Kevin Anyaeji, and it was produced by Wayne Wilkins.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
